# example_homem_na_estrada.ttl — Homem na Estrada
# Generated by scripts/split_examples.py from examples/case-studies.ttl (all works).
# Do not edit by hand: edit case-studies.ttl and run the script again.
# Lyrics and novel text are not stored; see docs/*/case-studies.md for the method.
@prefix aro: <https://w3id.org/aro/ontology#> .
@prefix dbr: <http://dbpedia.org/resource/> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix ex: <https://example.org/aro-cases/> .
